WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.734
Today is four words. They all end the same way.

2
00:00:03.184 --> 00:00:09.996
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:10.496 --> 00:00:13.075
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:13.575 --> 00:00:15.172
Say the first word. Me.

5
00:00:16.556 --> 00:00:17.383
As in moon.

6
00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:21.281
The last letter is the heart part. Here it says its own name.

7
00:00:21.731 --> 00:00:22.722
The word is me.

8
00:00:23.422 --> 00:00:25.659
The next word works the same way. We.

9
00:00:26.976 --> 00:00:27.937
The word is we.

10
00:00:28.637 --> 00:00:31.826
The other two are on the page. One starts with this sound.

11
00:00:33.121 --> 00:00:36.144
And one starts with a team. Two letters, one sound.

12
00:00:37.595 --> 00:00:41.524
All four end the same way. One heart to know, four words to keep.

13
00:00:41.974 --> 00:00:46.793
Map the first word together. Let your child tell you where the heart goes on the other three.

14
00:00:47.243 --> 00:00:54.300
Then step away. Sentences in job two, words from before in job three, and three words read to you at the end.
